es":8075},"state":{"digest":"3a93bcf0fdad8f9d708e70645bcd4b3d5a1857e3bc11cebda69e8265c7845eab","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ly.1/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-11-16T01:10:10.714315+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ly.1","local_name":"bob-cli-ly.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-ly","agent_clan_generation":"20261115164821","bead_id":"bob-cli-ly.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-ly[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Double-slash Go To Notes in Bob Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Typing a second real `/` after the `/` Go To trigger (or pasting a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]whole-draft `//query`) opens a Go To · Notes picker over the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]vault's living notes; picking a row opens that note in Obsidian [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]without writing anything, while `\\\\` still types one literal [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]backslash.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]note_goto_double_slash.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/note_goto_double_slash.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ly[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ly/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli note catalog module (tiers, kinds, rows, map, ranking)[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-note-catalog[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-note-catalog: build the read-only `note_catalog` module that walks [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the vault, applies the hidden tiers, classifies kinds, and produces [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ranked rows plus the empty-state map, with golden tests on a synthetic [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tier vault.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli `//` grammar claim, note_goto completion, Tasks [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]continuation, docs[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-note-goto[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-note-catalog[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-note-goto: claim whole-draft `//query` as `note_goto` across parse, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refusal, and completion; serve catalog rows; advertise `/` as the bare [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Go To continuation key; bump the grammar; update help, docs, and CLI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]CaptureCore Notes source, index, row presentation, open URL[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-note-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-note-core: decode the note_goto contract, add the `.noteGoto` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source, a note index with grouped map and filtered ranking, note row [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]anatomy, captions, and the line-less bob-open-notes URL, all unit-tested[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in CaptureCoreTests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Panel wiring, keys, accept and open, truthful fixtures, Mac [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]docs[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-note-panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-note-goto, mac-note-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-note-panel: wire `note_goto` into the panel model and key router [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](continuation, peel, consume rules), open notes read-only, add generated[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fixtures and panel tests, document the picker, and land green on macOS [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]No-blink scope swap, warm notes snapshot, accessibility, [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]closeout[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-note-polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-note-panel[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-note-polish: keep the card mounted across `/` and `//`, serve rows [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from a warm in-memory snapshot, announce scope changes, run the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]acceptance closeout, and write the decision strand only when its memory [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decision says yes.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-ly","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-ly.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-0beea77e24984b2a1b059832a56e244b","started_at":"2026-11-15T21:49:31.708675+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"b38ea01d2b13440842d026f0ef960dae4da8ffb3b88720e1016c5cf5da929d5d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ly.4/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"cc2de7c948ca6e343f12e5cf538475d8356d8ef548fd1c632f3c0dc2763ca80c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ly.4/meta.json","size_bytes":703},"prompt":{"digest":"b439f1a194e61405f8f26b9546e141efb740d806ed93e670f303f0a2f06136eb","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ly.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":211},"state":{"digest":"8a34d6a5b8d47bf8a27aba32e84a202da78f0d234837a1bb6c128fb6fe77eb83","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ly.4/state.json","size